    "After a sync, NOOP checks the last two days of heart rate for possible activity. It offers a suggestion for you to confirm; heart rate alone cannot prove a workout. Nothing is saved until you tap Save. Turning this off stops checks but keeps your workout history. Short or gentle sessions may need to be added manually. On \\(Platform.deviceNounPhrase) only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
