    "The tick marks about 4 sets a week â€” the point below which the research doesn't reliably detect growth. Above it, gains continue with strongly diminishing returns and no clear ceiling, so the bar has no \"full\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Strich markiert etwa 4 SÃ¤tze pro Woche â€“ den Punkt, unter dem die Forschung Wachstum nicht zuverlÃ¤ssig nachweist. DarÃ¼ber geht es weiter, mit stark abnehmendem Ertrag und ohne klare Obergrenze; der Balken hat deshalb kein â€žvollâ€œ."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The tick marks about 4 sets a week â€” the point below which the research doesn't reliably detect growth. Above it, gains continue with strongly diminishing returns and no clear ceiling, so the bar has no \"full\"."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La marca seÃ±ala unas 4 series por semana: el punto por debajo del cual la investigaciÃ³n no detecta crecimiento de forma fiable. Por encima, las ganancias continÃºan con rendimientos muy decrecientes y sin techo claro, asÃ­ que la barra no tiene Â«llenoÂ»."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le repÃ¨re marque environ 4 sÃ©ries par semaine â€” le seuil en dessous duquel la recherche ne dÃ©tecte pas de croissance de faÃ§on fiable. Au-dessus, les gains continuent avec de forts rendements dÃ©croissants et sans plafond net : la barre n'a donc pas de Â« plein Â»."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tacca segna circa 4 serie a settimana: il punto sotto il quale la ricerca non rileva la crescita in modo affidabile. Sopra, i guadagni continuano con rendimenti fortemente decrescenti e senza un tetto chiaro, quindi la barra non ha un Â«pienoÂ»."
